Description: phone camera app on libcamera
 omacam ("Camera") talks to the cameras through libcamera directly, not
 through PipeWire: tap to focus, pinch to zoom, photos from the camera's
 full-resolution mode, video as H.264/Opus in MP4.
 .
 Video needs the x264 or openh264 encoder of GStreamer (x264enc from
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly); the shutter sound plays camera-shutter.oga
 with canberra-gtk-play, pw-play or paplay.
